{"4224690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "King of Terror", "steam_appid": 4224690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hari ng Lagim (King of Terror) is a single-player mystery survival horror game that reels you in on the dark side of movie stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of filming, veteran actor Ricardo Dela Cruz finds himself trapped on the set of his latest movie that seems to slowly converge with scenes from his long hidden past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/46cba132433357dbe0dca02633430f1e.poster.avif?t=1774870159\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/46cba132433357dbe0dca02633430f1e.webm?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/46cba132433357dbe0dca02633430f1e.mp4?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lights, camera, action! Shoot and solve your way out of the intricately designed movie set and unravel the events of Ricardo's past thru flashbacks, script pages, and other clues scattered throughout the sound stage. Crack puzzles and find key items to unlock new areas and break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/02f87cb8ad5b5d4a262149aedbd51044.poster.avif?t=1774870159\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/02f87cb8ad5b5d4a262149aedbd51044.webm?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/02f87cb8ad5b5d4a262149aedbd51044.mp4?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather weapons, ammo, and healing items to fight the creatures that used to only exist in the stories of Ricardo's filmography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/7eae72aa3958197165dbe77829a2c3f2.poster.avif?t=1774870159\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/7eae72aa3958197165dbe77829a2c3f2.webm?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224690/extras/7eae72aa3958197165dbe77829a2c3f2.mp4?t=1774870159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a blockbuster experience that will twist your heart and mind as you try to escape the horrors abound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooting Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting and story inspired by Philippine folklore and pop culture</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hari ng Lagim (King of Terror) is a single-player mystery survival horror game that reels you in on the dark side of movie stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of filming, veteran actor Ricardo Dela Cruz finds himself trapped on the set of his latest movie that seems to slowly c